00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.100
Wild Crack!

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:09.400
Hey, it's the Krap Brothers here.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.380
I'm Chris, and this is my brother, Mark.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.180
Martin, I'm over here.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.520
Hey, what's with the medieval armor?

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.260
Well, this is my defense against one of the best defenses in the creature world.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.660
Ah, a turtle with a shell defense.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.120
Nope.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.760
A skunk with a spray defense?

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.140
No! I'll give you a hint.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.850
This creature has spikes over its body.

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:29.970
and hesitant.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.780
tiny black eyes, and lives in trees like this.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:33.720
Ah!

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:35.350
Oh-ho!

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:38.530
Now I know which defender you're talking about.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:41.980
A porcupine!

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.390
And I know firsthand what a great defense this creature has.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:51.540
These quills are sharp, and a porcupine's body is covered with them.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:55.850
Oh yeah, over 30,000 quills to be exact.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.210
But porcupines can't shoot their quills.

00:00:58.330 --> 00:00:59.690
They're loosely attached.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.780
So then if a predator tries to bite the porcupine,

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:05.840
the predator ends up with a nasty present.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:13.940
these porcupines spend a lot of time in the trees.

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:18.150
but another type of porcupine roams around on the ground.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:21.420
African crested porcupine!

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:22.600
Wow.

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:24.270
So quick!

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:25.720
And look at those

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:27.300
Huge quills!

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:29.980
All porcupines have the incredible...

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:37.750
quill defense. Imagine if we had the amazing quill power of the porcupine so we could experience

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:41.750
one of the great defenses of the creature world. What if?

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.300
I can fly in

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:35.300
Quilber's birthday present.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.600
Light is a great ride!

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:53.090
We're as free as a Marshall Eagle in the wilderness, bro.

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:57.050
Yeah, now only if we could get Aviva's birthday present

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.390
out here and not have to go shopping for it.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:02:59.980
He

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:08.410
We can find her a great birthday present right out here on the african savannah

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:17.820
What girl wouldn't want a present from the wilderness? Yeah, we'll get her something creaturey like a cool picture of a lion

